  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="12">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIIAtr">III Atr</ref> 12</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And æt cynges spǽce lecge man VI healfmarc wedd ⁊ æt eorles ⁊ biscopes XII óran wedd ⁊ æt ælcum þegene VI óran wedd.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And in the case of an action brought by the king, 6 half-marks shall be deposited as security, and in the case of one brought by an earl or a bishop, 12 ores, and of one brought by a thegn, 6 ores as security.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Et de placito regis ponatur uadium sex dimid. marcis, comitis et episcopi uadium duodecim oris.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
